OL,6,CG1988FRichard Whitmore presents a BBC
OL,7,FTV news programme for the final time.
OL,8,
OL,9,FAfter almost 25 years on the BBC staff,
OL,10,FRichard left to go freelance.
OL,11,
OL,12,FAt the end of News View, Moira Stuart
OL,13,Fsaid "goodnight" and Richard Whitmore
OL,14,Fsaid: "On my final news at Television
OL,15,FCentre, goodbye from me."
